title: Internal Security
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: police_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: spd_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "SPD" and police_timer <= 0
card-image: img/portraits/SeveringCarl.jpg

= Internal Security

The federal interior ministry runs the Federal Police, the Federal Criminal Police Office and the Verfassungsschutz, the domestic intelligence service. Most police work belongs to the Länder, but federal investigators can take on the big cases.

The Verfassungsschutz has a history of its own: it missed the NSU murders for years, and one of its former presidents now sits close to the far right.

- @loyalty: Reform the security services.
- @investigate_corruption: Go after tax fraud and money laundering.
- @investigate_far_right: Investigate right-wing extremist networks.
- @root: Take no action for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@loyalty
on-arrival: verfassungsschutz_loyalty += 0.1

We tighten parliamentary oversight, vet new recruits more carefully, and remove officers with links to extremist groups. It is slow work.

Current loyalty of the security services: [+ verfassungsschutz_loyalty : loyalty +]

@investigate_corruption
go-to: investigate_corruption_success if verfassungsschutz_loyalty >= 0.5; investigate_corruption_failure if verfassungsschutz_loyalty < 0.5

@investigate_corruption_success
on-arrival: investigate_corruption += 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); budget += 1 if investigate_corruption <= 2

A new federal financial crimes office brings cases against Cum-Ex bankers and money launderers in the property market. The money recovered goes into the budget, and Interior Minister [+ interior_minister +] is in every newspaper.

@investigate_corruption_failure

Our investigations come to nothing. The suspects seem to have known what was coming.

@investigate_far_right
go-to: investigate_far_right_success if verfassungsschutz_loyalty >= 0.55; investigate_far_right_failure if verfassungsschutz_loyalty < 0.55

@investigate_far_right_success
on-arrival: investigate_far_right += 1; workers_afd -= 3; new_middle_afd -= 3; afd_urgency += 1 if investigate_far_right == 2; afd_urgency += 2 if investigate_far_right == 3; workers_afd -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; new_middle_afd -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; old_middle_afd -= 3 if investigate_far_right == 3; firewall_erosion -= 1 if firewall_erosion >= 7

[? if investigate_far_right == 1 : We uncover a Reichsbürger network that was planning attacks on members of parliament. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 2 : We find illegal weapons caches held by a far-right network with members in the police and the army reserve. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right == 3 : Leaked chats show AfD officials planning mass deportations of German citizens with a migrant background. The party says the chats are taken out of context. ?]
[? if investigate_far_right > 3 : Everyone knew what these networks were planning. Now there is proof that will stand up in court. ?]

[? if firewall_erosion >= 6: Some in the Union still say that the AfD is a normal conservative party. These findings make that harder to argue. ?]

@investigate_far_right_failure

Our investigations come to nothing. The suspects seem to have known what was coming.
